(JAL NIGAM — Tender EE/CIV/43/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This specification covers design, supply and commissioning of raw water pumping) Tj T*
(machinery complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — HORIZONTAL CENTRIFUGAL PUMPS) Tj T*
(\(a\) The pumps shall comply with IS 1520:1980.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Duty point of each pump shall be 250 m^3/h at 45 metre total head.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Pump efficiency at the duty point shall be 78% \(percent\) minimum.) Tj T*
(\(d\) The pump casing shall be cast iron and the impeller bronze.) Tj T*
(\(e\) The pumpset noise level measured 1 metre away shall be limited to 85 decibels \(A\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PUMP DATA SHEET) Tj T*
(Rated discharge: 250 m^3/h) Tj T*
(Rated total head: 45 metre) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — DRIVE MOTORS) Tj T*
(\(a\) Squirrel cage induction motors complying with IS 325:1996 shall be supplied.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Motor rated output shall be 37 kilowatt.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Motors are to operate on 415 V AC ± 10% \(percent\), 50 Hertz ± 5% \(percent\), three) Tj T*
(phase supply.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Motors shall meet efficiency class IE3 of IS 12615:2018.) Tj T*
(\(e\) The motor enclosure shall have IP55 degree of protection.) Tj T*
(\(f\) Insulation shall be class F, with temperature rise restricted to class B, for) Tj T*
(continuous S1 duty.) Tj T*
(\(g\) The motor synchronous speed shall be 1500 rev/min.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — LT POWER AND CONTROL CABLES) Tj T*
(\(a\) LT power cables shall be aluminium conductor, XLPE insulated, armoured, PVC) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 5) Tj T*
