(\(b\) The size of the main feeder cable shall be 3.5 core 300 Sq mm.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Maximum continuous conductor temperature of the cables shall be 90 ?.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Copper conductor control cables of 2.5 Sq mm, PVC insulated, 1.1 kV grade shall) Tj T*
