(every drum.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 6: TESTING, INSPECTION AND CERTIFICATION) Tj T*
(\(a\) Works testing of the pumps shall be done as per IS 9137.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Each motor shall be subjected to routine tests as per IS 4029.) Tj T*
(\(c\) All motors shall carry the ISI mark.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Testing of the cables shall be done as per IS 10810.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Each consignment of cables shall be accompanied by routine test certificates.) Tj T*
(\(f\) Before despatch, the Engineer-in-charge will inspect the equipment at the maker's) Tj T*
(works.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7 DOCUMENTATION, WARRANTY AND TRAINING) Tj T*
(\(a\) Detailed shop drawings are to be submitted by the contractor for approval not later) Tj T*
(than 21 calendar days after the award of work.) Tj T*
(\(b\) On completion the contractor shall hand over three copies of the O&M manuals.) Tj T*
(\(c\) The contractor shall guarantee the whole installation for 12 months after handing) Tj T*
(over against faulty design, materials and workmanship.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Operation and routine maintenance training shall be given by the contractor to the) Tj T*
(Department's operators.) Tj T*
